What about the gas ? What are you talking about ?

248
00:23:31,120 --> 00:23:34,080
I 'm telling you that we need to separate .

249
00:23:34,120 --> 00:23:36,400
Yes , I want a divorce .

250
00:23:36,480 --> 00:23:39,120
You are young , you are strong .

251
00:23:39,160 --> 00:23:40,760
You can make a nice living .

252
00:23:43,440 --> 00:23:47,840
The school was part of my dowry , so I 'II take it back .

253
00:23:47,880 --> 00:23:51,200
We 'II start the proceedings right after the holidays .

254
00:23:53,920 --> 00:23:55,960
- What ? - Don 't give me that crap . I 'm coming .

255
00:23:56,000 --> 00:23:57,440
I 'II take a train tomorrow morning .

256
00:23:57,480 --> 00:23:58,880
I 'II meet you at nicole 's .

257
00:24:06,560 --> 00:24:10,480
- So ? - He 's coming tomorrow on the evening train .

258
00:24:28,480 --> 00:24:29,680
well , Germaine ?

259
00:24:48,200 --> 00:24:49,720
You 're nuts . You 'II catch cold .

260
00:24:49,760 --> 00:24:51,480
I 'm not cold . I 'm suffocating .

261
00:25:10,320 --> 00:25:13,280
- You 've got fever . - No , I 'm just hot .

262
00:25:15,040 --> 00:25:17,160
I thought you 'd never come back .

263
00:25:17,200 --> 00:25:18,840
That he 'd get here before you .

264
00:25:18,880 --> 00:25:20,400
It doesn 't always go as you want it to .

265
00:25:20,440 --> 00:25:21,640
That 's life . Everything was closed .

266
00:25:23,840 --> 00:25:25,240
Did you buy a tablecloth ?

267
00:25:25,280 --> 00:25:29,600
Yes , a nylon , waterproof one .

268
00:25:31,040 --> 00:25:34,840
- It 's too big ! - It won 't be big for him .

269
00:25:41,280 --> 00:25:45,920
Guess how much ? 2500 francs .

270
00:25:45,920 --> 00:25:50,440
That 's how they make money . Let 's open it .

271
00:25:50,480 --> 00:25:52,160
That way it won 't look weird .

272
00:25:58,400 --> 00:26:00,080
well , Iet 's not waste it .

273
00:26:03,240 --> 00:26:07,160
- Here , it will cheer you up . - No .

274
00:26:10,200 --> 00:26:12,720
You should , it 's not bad at all . I 've never had that before .

275
00:26:12,760 --> 00:26:15,320
- You 're supposed to put water in it . - It would be a waste .

276
00:26:15,520 --> 00:26:17,360
Hand me the small bottle .

277
00:26:24,880 --> 00:26:27,600
- Won 't he notice anything ? - Not a thing .

278
00:26:28,960 --> 00:26:31,440
He 'II sleep like a log .

279
00:26:31,480 --> 00:26:35,160
- will it leave any traces ? - None .

280
00:26:35,200 --> 00:26:37,320
It 's a sedative . He 'II digest it .

281
00:26:37,360 --> 00:26:38,880
I 'm sure he won 't come .

282
00:26:43,040 --> 00:26:47,320
That 's him . That 's his train .

283
00:26:47,360 --> 00:26:49,080
Put that over there .

284
00:27:07,480 --> 00:27:10,920
Stop , please , stop .

285
00:27:10,960 --> 00:27:11,880
It 's awful .

286
00:27:14,920 --> 00:27:17,640
- We must fill it up . - I can 't do it .

287
00:27:17,680 --> 00:27:20,320
I can 't do it , not today .

288
00:27:22,040 --> 00:27:25,160
We must do it , and you know it as well as I do .

289
00:27:25,200 --> 00:27:28,680
- It 's either today or never . - Then never !

290
00:27:28,720 --> 00:27:31,000
Let 's forget about it . I can 't handle this .

291
00:27:35,880 --> 00:27:38,840
As you wish . But I must warn you .

292
00:27:38,880 --> 00:27:41,120
If you miss your chance he won 't miss his .

293
00:27:41,120 --> 00:27:43,320
Not after your phone call .

294
00:27:43,360 --> 00:27:48,720
I don 't know . I just don 't know anymore .

295
00:27:48,760 --> 00:27:52,840
nicole , please , help me .

296
00:27:52,880 --> 00:27:55,680
What for ? It 's beyond your strength anyway .

297
00:27:55,720 --> 00:27:59,000
I should have never trusted you .

298
00:27:59,040 --> 00:28:02,000
I got involved too , and you abandoned me .

299
00:28:02,040 --> 00:28:04,880
Yes , you 're right . I 'm not worth anything .

300
00:28:04,920 --> 00:28:08,440
I 'm just a ruin , a little ruin .

301
00:28:08,480 --> 00:28:12,200
That 's what he said . But ...

302
00:28:12,240 --> 00:28:16,120
the little ruin will get her revenge . She 'II do it .

303
00:28:16,160 --> 00:28:19,160
Even if she collapses afterward .

304
00:28:19,200 --> 00:28:21,000
My only regret ...

305
00:28:21,040 --> 00:28:23,720
is that he 'II never know that I killed him .

306
00:28:23,760 --> 00:28:27,920
Come on , before you were giving up , now you 're excited .

307
00:28:27,960 --> 00:28:32,080
What you need is to relax .

308
00:28:32,120 --> 00:28:35,680
relax a Iot . You must keep cool .

309
00:28:35,720 --> 00:28:38,760
I will . I swear that I will .

310
00:28:43,600 --> 00:28:45,720
I must go upstairs and see them .

311
00:28:45,760 --> 00:28:47,880
Can 't you stay with me ?

312
00:28:47,920 --> 00:28:50,520
If the Herbouxes look out the window and ...

313
00:28:50,560 --> 00:28:53,920
- see him come in ... - You 'II come right away , won 't you ?

314
00:28:53,960 --> 00:28:56,600
As fast as I can , I promise .

315
00:28:56,640 --> 00:29:01,120
Be brave , in half an hour , it will all be over .

316
00:29:32,920 --> 00:29:35,560
I 'II find her a husband . I 'II redeem myself .

317
00:29:35,600 --> 00:29:38,880
She 's young , she 'II be rich and she 'II be happy .

318
00:29:40,680 --> 00:29:44,520
I wasn 't expecting you tonight .

319
00:29:44,560 --> 00:29:47,640
Mme. DeIassaIIe is resting and I 'm not tired .

320
00:29:47,680 --> 00:29:50,200
- May I come in ? - please , do .

321
00:29:51,400 --> 00:29:53,760
We were listening to the radio . We 've finished eating .

322
00:29:55,240 --> 00:29:58,080
The drama is over .

323
00:29:58,080 --> 00:30:01,040
Zapi Max starts in a few seconds .

324
00:30:01,080 --> 00:30:03,480
Dear listeners , you 've just heard ...

325
00:30:03,520 --> 00:30:07,440
" One should Never Laugh at Love " by alfred de Musset .

326
00:30:38,360 --> 00:30:39,320
God !

327
00:30:57,680 --> 00:31:00,640
- Good evening , michel . - Good evening .

328
00:31:00,680 --> 00:31:01,840
Come in .

329
00:31:13,600 --> 00:31:15,440
So , are you proud of yourself ?

330
00:31:15,480 --> 00:31:17,560
Not so loud , the neighbors .

331
00:31:17,600 --> 00:31:21,440
Don 't worry . I don 't want to be noticed .

332
00:31:21,480 --> 00:31:23,640
A man who runs after his wife is ridiculous enough .

333
00:31:25,360 --> 00:31:28,120
I Ieft the school like a thief .

334
00:31:28,160 --> 00:31:32,160
I had to hide from PIantiveau .

335
00:31:32,200 --> 00:31:34,800
Hiding from my own doorkeeper !

336
00:31:34,840 --> 00:31:36,000
It 's humiliating .

337
00:31:37,320 --> 00:31:39,200
I couldn 't tell him where I was going .

338
00:31:41,240 --> 00:31:44,480
You have forced me to come , what are you waiting for ?

339
00:31:44,480 --> 00:31:46,640
- What ? - Pack your bags .

340
00:31:48,400 --> 00:31:49,760
- No ! - What ?

341
00:31:51,360 --> 00:31:53,960
- I 'm staying . - Are you refusing to come ?

342
00:31:54,000 --> 00:31:56,080
I thought that was clear .

343
00:31:56,120 --> 00:31:57,880
I 'II come back after our divorce .

344
00:31:57,920 --> 00:32:02,000
- Have you decided to get a divorce , you ? - Yes .

345
00:32:02,040 --> 00:32:04,280
With your religious beliefs ?

346
00:32:04,320 --> 00:32:06,560
I won 't get married again , that 's all .

347
00:32:06,560 --> 00:32:09,480
But getting a divorce is like getting married ...

348
00:32:09,520 --> 00:32:11,360
we must both agree .

349
00:32:11,400 --> 00:32:15,400
- My lawyer doesn 't think so . - You have a lawyer ?

350
00:32:15,840 --> 00:32:19,840
- Attorney Berthoux , 64 Victor Hugo . - Berthoux ?

351
00:32:19,880 --> 00:32:22,640
You can check in the phone book .

352
00:32:22,680 --> 00:32:24,880
I went to see him this morning ...

353
00:32:24,920 --> 00:32:28,560
and he assured me that I 'd get the legal separation quickly .

354
00:32:28,600 --> 00:32:31,160
He told you that ?

355
00:32:31,600 --> 00:32:33,720
Funny lawyer !

356
00:32:34,120 --> 00:32:37,600
- Of course , I told him ... - You told him ...

357
00:32:37,640 --> 00:32:40,360
all of our secrets ... about our private life .

358
00:32:40,400 --> 00:32:42,160
You told everything to a stranger ?

359
00:32:42,200 --> 00:32:44,480
An animal who enjoyed every word of it ?

360
00:32:44,520 --> 00:32:48,560
You , the former nun !

361
00:32:48,600 --> 00:32:52,400
I 'm telling you , it 's disgusting !

362
00:32:52,440 --> 00:32:55,920
Didn 't you talk about us to your lovers ?

363
00:32:55,960 --> 00:32:58,040
Do we still have secrets ?

364
00:32:58,080 --> 00:33:00,160
Is there anything that nicole doesn 't know ?

365
00:33:00,200 --> 00:33:03,840
Her ! If you believe her ! Two words , three lies .

366
00:33:03,880 --> 00:33:05,840
There are details that she couldn 't have invented .

367
00:33:05,880 --> 00:33:08,920
She can invent anything !

368
00:33:08,960 --> 00:33:11,920
God knows what she told the lawyer !

369
00:33:11,960 --> 00:33:13,760
- I 'II go see him , and put things straight . - No !

370
00:33:13,800 --> 00:33:16,440
- You won 't stop me . - No , later . Tomorrow .

371
00:33:16,480 --> 00:33:18,480
- Right now , he must be having supper - well , I didn 't eat .

372
00:33:18,520 --> 00:33:19,880
- He won 't receive you . - We 'II see .

373
00:33:19,920 --> 00:33:21,240
When I tell him that I came all the way from Paris ...

374
00:33:21,280 --> 00:33:25,960
Don 't . I didn 't see a lawyer . I lied to you .

375
00:33:26,000 --> 00:33:30,720
You too . It 's contagious .

376
00:33:34,080 --> 00:33:39,080
So , what about the divorce , was that a lie too ?

377
00:33:39,120 --> 00:33:43,960
No , I really want the divorce . It 's the only way .

378
00:33:44,000 --> 00:33:47,480
For your sake as well , michel .

379
00:33:47,520 --> 00:33:50,480
- It will be better for both of us . - Come on , Cricri .

380
00:33:50,520 --> 00:33:54,040
You can 't be serious . Do you know the price of a divorce ?

381
00:33:54,080 --> 00:33:57,520
- And what about the scandal ? - What scandal ?

382
00:33:57,560 --> 00:34:01,280
I 'II have to take a lawyer to defend myself .

383
00:34:01,280 --> 00:34:05,400
And lawyers never stop talking .

384
00:34:05,440 --> 00:34:08,440
Parents won 't entrust you with their children .

385
00:34:08,520 --> 00:34:10,680
- They 'II take the children away from me ? - Of course .

386
00:34:10,720 --> 00:34:12,800
You 'II go bankrupt . Not that I care much .

387
00:34:12,840 --> 00:34:15,000
If it were up to me , I would have sold it a Iong time ago .

388
00:34:15,040 --> 00:34:18,640
With your money and my contacts I 'd have gone into business .

389
00:34:20,520 --> 00:34:25,360
We could have lived comfortably .

390
00:34:27,080 --> 00:34:29,920
But you wanted this kid business . I gave in .

391
00:34:29,920 --> 00:34:33,600
- It was security . - Big deal !

392
00:34:33,640 --> 00:34:35,720
We traded in the big car for a small one .

393
00:34:35,760 --> 00:34:37,720
I gave up my training .

394
00:34:37,760 --> 00:34:40,040
I used my old suits .

395
00:34:40,080 --> 00:34:42,560
We are rich and we live like poor people .

396
00:34:42,600 --> 00:34:45,280
Do you know how I paid for my trip ?

397
00:34:45,920 --> 00:34:48,840
I sold my dictionary , my big dictionary .

398
00:34:52,080 --> 00:34:55,240
And I did that for you .

399
00:34:55,280 --> 00:34:57,280
believe me that I don 't regret a thing .

400
00:34:57,320 --> 00:34:59,920
But when you throw me out ...

401
00:34:59,960 --> 00:35:04,760
it upsets me , Cricri . It upsets me a Iot .

402
00:35:04,840 --> 00:35:09,000
But anyway , you made me feel miserable .

403
00:35:08,960 --> 00:35:12,120
We used to fight , Iike every other couple .

404
00:35:14,000 --> 00:35:17,000
well , girls , what about this !

405
00:35:17,040 --> 00:35:23,320
Wait . Don 't lie . You mustn 't lie now .

406
00:35:23,360 --> 00:35:26,560
You made me very unhappy .

407
00:35:26,560 --> 00:35:30,640
You might not have been aware of that , but it 's the truth .

408
00:35:30,680 --> 00:35:32,600
- Ask nicole . - please , don 't talk about ...

409
00:35:32,640 --> 00:35:34,880
that bitch . She 's setting you up against me .

410
00:35:34,880 --> 00:35:37,200
She exploits the fact that you 're sick . She has a good mind .

411
00:35:37,240 --> 00:35:41,240
Yes . She 's got knowledge , taste ...

412
00:35:41,280 --> 00:35:43,880
- Taste ? - Maybe . But she doesn 't have a good mind .

413
00:35:43,920 --> 00:35:45,640
That 's it . I 'm firing her right away ...

414
00:35:45,680 --> 00:35:48,040
and we 'II replace her with a man . A good , honest , old man .

415
00:35:48,080 --> 00:35:50,720
- michel ! - For God 's sake ! My Prince of wales suit !

416
00:35:50,760 --> 00:35:53,560
You idiot ! Go get a handkerchief , a towel !

417
00:35:53,600 --> 00:35:55,160
It will stain and I 'II stink of alcohol .

418
00:35:56,480 --> 00:35:57,600
Just go !

419
00:36:04,000 --> 00:36:05,360
Here and here .

420
00:36:07,040 --> 00:36:10,240
It doesn 't pay to be nice to you .

421
00:36:10,280 --> 00:36:12,040
I will break you , girl .

422
00:36:26,080 --> 00:36:27,840
well , what are you waiting for ?

423
00:36:42,880 --> 00:36:44,760
Bring some hot water .

424
00:36:54,640 --> 00:36:58,120
We 're leaving now and we 'II be back tomorrow morning .

425
00:36:58,160 --> 00:37:01,120
How long did you have to drive ? Ten , twelve hours ?

426
00:37:03,360 --> 00:37:04,400
well , answer !

427
00:37:06,400 --> 00:37:09,080
Can 't you talk ?

428
00:37:12,840 --> 00:37:17,760
Eh , woman , another glass !

429
00:37:25,040 --> 00:37:27,200
I don 't know ... I feel dizzy .

430
00:37:30,320 --> 00:37:31,640
You can 't measure anymore .

431
00:37:35,240 --> 00:37:36,960
That 's enough .

432
00:37:41,640 --> 00:37:42,880
Nice color .

433
00:37:46,920 --> 00:37:49,280
Stop looking at me with your insane eyes .

434
00:37:51,480 --> 00:37:53,720
Who 's paying ? The princess ?

435
00:37:56,760 --> 00:38:00,880
By the way , where is she ? Is she scared ? Hiding ?

436
00:38:00,920 --> 00:38:03,640
She 's upstairs visiting the tenants .

437
00:38:03,680 --> 00:38:06,880
MademoiseIIe has tenants . She never told me that .

438
00:38:11,400 --> 00:38:16,160
- I 'm exhausted . It 's the train . - Just lie down .

439
00:38:19,080 --> 00:38:22,240
- Whose bed is this ? Hers or yours ? - Ours .

440
00:38:22,280 --> 00:38:23,920
That 's a scream .

441
00:38:25,520 --> 00:38:28,160
Shoes . Take off my shoes .

442
00:38:36,200 --> 00:38:38,080
What 's the matter with me tonight ?

443
00:38:46,520 --> 00:38:51,200
I don 't want to sleep . I don 't want to sleep .

444
00:38:54,440 --> 00:38:55,960
We have to leave .

445
00:39:03,480 --> 00:39:05,000
What are you doing ?

446
00:39:08,800 --> 00:39:11,960
- Just sleep . - Why did you turn off the light ?

447
00:39:16,960 --> 00:39:18,800
I 'm so tired !

448
00:39:20,240 --> 00:39:24,440
- What 's the matter ? - Nothing . Go to sleep .

449
00:39:31,280 --> 00:39:35,120
- How did you get in ? - I came through this door .

450
00:39:35,160 --> 00:39:37,760
- How many drinks did he have ? - Three .

451
00:39:37,800 --> 00:39:41,200
He was very good .

452
00:39:50,960 --> 00:39:51,680
He 's dreaming .

453
00:40:11,680 --> 00:40:13,560
He 's ready . We can take him .

454
00:40:16,280 --> 00:40:17,840
Take off his shoes .

455
00:40:32,000 --> 00:40:35,360
- What the hell is she doing ? - She 's taking a bath .

456
00:40:35,400 --> 00:40:39,000
At 10 P.M. ? Funny habits . Oh , shit !

457
00:40:40,160 --> 00:40:44,440
tell me , sir , where are the Straits of Mozambique ?

458
00:40:44,480 --> 00:40:46,320
Between Madagascar and Africa !

459
00:40:46,360 --> 00:40:48,360
It is precisely located between Madagascar ...

460
00:40:48,400 --> 00:40:50,560
and the Coast of Africa . Bravo , sir !

461
00:40:53,680 --> 00:40:55,800
32,000 francs !

462
00:40:55,840 --> 00:40:58,240
I must ask you now : what do you want to do ?

463
00:40:58,280 --> 00:41:01,440
- Do you stop or do you carry on ? - I will go on .

464
00:41:01,440 --> 00:41:02,720
Of course , I carry on .

465
00:41:05,840 --> 00:41:09,720
I was winning 32,000 francs and I can 't hear a thing now !

466
00:41:09,760 --> 00:41:14,160
- Poor baby ! - Bitches ! Bitches ! Daughters of bitches !

467
00:41:14,200 --> 00:41:16,920
I didn 't even hear the question !

468
00:41:16,960 --> 00:41:20,440
Midnight baths ! The decline of Rome !

469
00:41:22,640 --> 00:41:25,000
It 's a problem of enjoyment !

470
00:41:25,040 --> 00:41:27,520
I have the right to send her a registered letter .

471
00:41:27,560 --> 00:41:29,440
And I 'm not saying that I won 't do it .

472
00:41:31,600 --> 00:41:38,240
The 17th at 10 : 05 , 06 P.M.

473
00:41:39,520 --> 00:41:43,120
- What are you looking for ? - His return ticket .

474
00:41:45,640 --> 00:41:46,680
Here it is .

475
00:41:47,840 --> 00:41:49,600
With the restaurant bill .

476
00:41:53,000 --> 00:41:53,920
Burn it .

477
00:42:13,040 --> 00:42:17,360
Let 's go . You take the feet . It 's lighter .

478
00:42:17,400 --> 00:42:18,360
Together .

479
00:43:02,720 --> 00:43:04,080
The bronze ...

480
00:43:06,200 --> 00:43:07,800
The bronze on the mantel

481
00:43:27,120 --> 00:43:28,120
Give it to me .

482
00:43:33,240 --> 00:43:34,640
Now , the tablecloth .

483
00:43:38,200 --> 00:43:39,160
The tablecloth .

484
00:44:12,000 --> 00:44:13,120
It 's over .

485
00:44:18,600 --> 00:44:19,960
Did he suffer too much ?

486
00:44:22,120 --> 00:44:24,360
He didn 't feel anything .

487
00:44:24,400 --> 00:44:28,240
Let 's go right away and bring him back tonight .

488
00:44:28,280 --> 00:44:30,560
What about our alibi ?

489
00:44:30,560 --> 00:44:32,560
When they find him , we 'II have to be able to prove ...

490
00:44:32,600 --> 00:44:35,080
that we were here the day he died .

491
00:44:35,120 --> 00:44:37,600
That 's why I 'm using the idiots upstairs .

492
00:44:37,640 --> 00:44:39,960
She still hasn 't emptied the tub .

493
00:44:40,000 --> 00:44:42,680
- So what ? - So I can 't go to sleep .

494
00:44:42,720 --> 00:44:45,400
When she opens the drain , the noise will start again .

495
00:44:45,440 --> 00:44:47,280
It won 't fall on your bed .

496
00:44:47,320 --> 00:44:49,360
I can 't sleep under Niagara falls .

497
00:44:50,320 --> 00:44:53,400
- Are you planning to stay up all night ? - I 'm sitting down .

498
00:44:57,200 --> 00:44:58,680
I 'II give her until midnight .

499
00:45:16,280 --> 00:45:19,600
- Here they are ! - They took their time .

500
00:45:19,640 --> 00:45:21,200
When I passed by the cafe , at twelve ...

501
